who has been greatly impacted over the last couple of weeks.

16
00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:57.790
I would ask your students like,

17
00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:02.270
hey, who has really just like their mind completely blown

18
00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:04.870
and needs to like just get it off their chest

19
00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.950
about what this means because now they're gonna have

20
00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:11.950
a changed life moving in the direction that God desires.

21
00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:14.510
